{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39287","headline":"泛鄱阳湖 · 韦庄","name":"泛鄱阳湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四顾无边鸟不飞，大波惊隔楚山微。\n纷纷雨外灵均过，瑟瑟云中帝子归。\n迸鲤似梭投远浪，小舟如叶傍斜晖。\n鸱夷去後何人到，爱者虽多见者稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}